  "evidencia": "Page: Starrcade (1992). Sentence: Starrcade (1992): BattleBowl/The Lethal Lottery II was a major annual professional wrestling show, broadcast on pay-per-view (PPV) that took place on December 28, 1992, from The Omni in Atlanta, Georgia.\nPage: Starrcade (1992). Sentence: The show also saw Ron Simmons defend the WCW World Heavyweight Championship against \"Dr. Death\" Steve Williams, the team of Shane Douglas and Ricky Steamboat putting the WCW World Tag Team Championship on the line against the team of Brian Pillman and Barry Windham and Masahiro Chono defend the NWA World Heavyweight Championship against The Great Muta.\nPage: &quot;Dr. Death&quot; Steve Williams. Sentence: Steven Williams (May 14, 1960 – December 29, 2009), better known by his ring name \"Dr. Death\" Steve Williams, was an American professional wrestler, author, former collegiate football player, and amateur wrestler at the University of Oklahoma.",
